Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 13:20:16 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 295/333] [ae-patch] Decide the preset advisor on the server so
 a terminal host renders the line

The advisor line read decision_advisor.available() at render time, but a
terminal-mode host renders the lead's notice with no AE_DECISION_* env, so the
line was dropped. _resolve_roles now stores advisor: true when it is available
and _advisor_line reads only that flag. advisor_owner no longer rides in the
notice metadata.
